"target": 9,
"set_flag": "q1_done"
}, {
"text": "Who are you?",
"target": 11
}, {
"text": "Can you PLEASE tell me how I got here... Please...",
"target": 13
}, {
"text": "Why is it Love and Tragedy.",
"target": 15,
"condition_flag": "q1_done"
}, {
"text": "Bye",
